              "name": "Preserve historical rates explanation",
              "fill": "#202020",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Adding an effective-dated rate retains earlier periods. Past receipts stay as actually recorded. Interest settings are optional; ordinary income must never be redirected or relabeled as savings interest.",
