          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Use 600 for links on 50 or 100; underline links. Essential icons and control boundaries need ≥ 3:1 against adjacent colors. Never encode income, expense or status by color alone. Components and semantic states belong to P01.10.",
